# vnewindow skills

Task playbooks for this repository live in `skills/`, one `SKILL.md` per skill.
Read the matching skill before doing that kind of work:

- `skills/vne-coding-style/SKILL.md` - C++ / Objective-C++ naming, formatting, modern C++.
- `skills/plain-ascii-authoring/SKILL.md` - ASCII-only text, no AI glyphs or filler.
- `skills/vne-header-hygiene/SKILL.md` - include order, header self-containment.
- `skills/vne-build-verify/SKILL.md` - format, build, and test pipeline via scripts.
- `skills/vne-testing/SKILL.md` - GoogleTest layout, determinism, null-backend tests.
- `skills/vne-xwin-platforms/SKILL.md` - platform backends, native handles, thread rules.

There is no shader / GPU-layout skill in this repo. See `skills/README.md`.
